                <pb facs="0231" n="129" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg129"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4992.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-03-08"><hi rendition="#italic">March 8,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Horace G. McKinley convicted of conspiracy to defraud United States Government
                    forfeited bail and fled to China. Supposed to be running small hotel on
                    outskirts of Shanghai. Inquire of Chinese foreign office whether request for his
                    extradition would be granted as act of comity, but state that this Government is
                    prevented by its laws from being able to reciprocate the favor should occasion
                    arise.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
